From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arkadiusz Hiler <ahiler@codeweavers.com>
Date: Mon, 15 Jun 2026 16:22:52 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] dmloader: Log ERR when soundfonts are used.

So it's visible in the logs with the default channels on and it's easily
grepable.

(cherry picked from commit 81d78e4f3ea8ce868d775021fdc9f90122dc1a6b)
---
 dlls/dmloader/loader.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/dlls/dmloader/loader.c b/dlls/dmloader/loader.c
index ce096bd0c4c..46171e7cb14 100644
--- a/dlls/dmloader/loader.c
+++ b/dlls/dmloader/loader.c
@@ -902,6 +902,7 @@ static const IDirectMusicLoader8Vtbl loader_vtbl =
 static inline void touch_soundfont_used_tag(void)
 {
     WCHAR env[MAX_PATH];
+    ERR("Creating the soundfont-used file.\n");
 
     if (GetEnvironmentVariableW(L"STEAM_COMPAT_TRANSCODED_MEDIA_PATH", env, ARRAY_SIZE(env)))
     {
